<http://www.semanticweb.org/AMISecOnto/High> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                      <http://www.semanticweb.org/AMISecOnto/SeverityLevel> .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/AMISecOnto/Low
<http://www.semanticweb.org/AMISecOnto/Low> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                     <http://www.semanticweb.org/AMISecOnto/SeverityLevel> .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/AMISecOnto/Medium
